Explore mode allows you to check out what works and what doesn't.  I just
tested for Wizards and Barbarians.  In both cases, teleport control did
not change the effects of magic whistles.  The wizard was able to use
it properly at level 1 with and without teleport control.  The barbarian
had to be level 10 before the whistle worked properly, and again, teleport
control was not a factor.
